## Model card

- **Name:** GLM-4.6V-Flash
- **Short description:** Z.ai's lightweight vision model (released 2025-12-08) built around a 9B language backbone, for visual reasoning, documents and multimodal agents on local/edge hardware.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai (`glm-4.6v-flash`), Hugging Face (`zai-org/GLM-4.6V-Flash`, ~10B), plus ~5 routes. Open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-12-08; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `glm-4.6v-flash`, `zai-org/GLM-4.6V-Flash`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens; max output 32,768.
- **Modalities:** text, image and video in; text out; tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** free/open weights; the catalogue shows $0/$0.
- **Architecture:** open-weight VL model, ~9–10B language backbone (Z.ai).

