## Search notes

- `benchlm.ai/models/glm-4-6v-flash` → HTTP 404; village LLM Atlas says "not ranked — too few benchmarks"; llm-bench.io only has throughput data.
- Z.ai's docs evaluate the **GLM-4.6V** (106B) flagship, not the Flash member, so its MMBench/MathVista/OCRBench numbers are a different checkpoint and were not transferred.
- Resolution: spec facts above are catalog-verified; the benchmark columns stay empty.

